      "created_at": "2017-09-29T21:13:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You could also see the environments as being linked to each hero's primary nemesis.&nbsp; Akash'bhuta once protected Insula Primalis and she has some card art there.&nbsp; Most of the Infinitor encounters take place in space somewhere.&nbsp; Dok'Thorath and the Court of Blood are obvious.&nbsp; That would suggest Megalopolis for Haka, since that's the environment most commonly identifiable in&nbsp;<span>Ambuscade's&nbsp;</span><span>card art.</span></p><p><span>Magmaria's a good guess too, though.&nbsp; Xtreme Haka's incap art seems to show a lava environment.</span></p>",
