      "created_at": "2017-10-02T17:18:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, if it's about redirecting damage to him, and a specific environment, then I would say that Enduring Intercession would be the key card.&nbsp; The big problem that I see if it's Magmaria is that (aside from the Behemoths) there's not actually that much damage there for him to redirect.</p><p>Obviously, I'm just hypothesizing, but if you want environments that deal of ton of damage for him to redirect, I'd lean towards maybe Ruins of Atlantis, or even Rats and Vats.&nbsp; Though, most of the environments have been thematically driven.</p>",
